data: {"id": "6e1d4d60a2704cdc-thinking-parallel_evidence-990", "run_id": "6e1d4d60a2704cdc", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 状态确认\n- **Phase**: Pending，**Node**: None（未调度到任何节点）\n- **Pod UID**: 840e1f30-952d-4886-9edd-e96097582f87\n- **创建时间**: 2026-09-10T10:19:45Z，至今未变\n- **Prometheus 指标** `kube_pod_status_phase`: phase=Pending 值为 1，其他状态均为 0，确认当前始终处于 Pending\n\n### 2. 调度失败事件（根因关键证据）\n- 两次 `FailedScheduling` 事件：\n  - 25m 前首次发生\n  - 14m 前（连续 x2，间隔 19m）再次发生\n- **拒绝原文**: `\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector. preemption: 3 Preemption is not helpful for scheduling.\"`\n\n### ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789037105397, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

